# NIT Calicut website revamp

Design rationale for the [homepage prototype](README.md). The reference site is [nitc.ac.in](https://nitc.ac.in).

## Design goals

| Area | What the redesign aims to improve |
| --- | --- |
| Navigation | Give admissions, academics, departments, and placements clear paths. |
| Visual hierarchy | Make key actions, campus announcements, and events easier to scan. |
| Mobile layout | Reflow content for smaller screens and keep navigation accessible. |
| Performance | Keep image sizes and loading behavior in mind when adding media. |
| Campus identity | Give campus life, research, events, and achievements space on the homepage. |

The concept considers prospective and current students, faculty and staff, alumni, recruiters, and international visitors.

Maintained by Krishna Jha.
